  sequence:
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Hey, did you see that!? I just beat up like six guys!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Yeah... With my help...
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Fern
    character: 23
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Fern
    content:
    - Th-thanks, guys. I couldn't have gotten out of this without you two...
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - What were you doing with them, anyway?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Yeah, why're you letting them steal from you!?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Fern
    character: 23
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Fern
    content:
    - They're just a bad group I got involved with last year...
    - They've been finding me and taking everything I had at the end of every week.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Well, you won't have to worry about them anymore!
    - Now that you're an adventurer, you've got the whole guild watching your back!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Fern
    character: 23
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Fern
    content:
    - Thanks, Cherry... And you too, Damson.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - I'm just doing my job.
    - We should leave. Those thieves might return with more friends.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Right!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
